WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
Alice approves. The request records her ID and zero release intents.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.600
Alice approves again. The self-loop rejects the duplicate.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.900
Bob approves. The request records one release intent.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.200
Alice tries again. The closed state rejects the approval.
